lenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 epic bosses</strong>, each requiring a unique strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Events</strong> with surprises adding depth to your adventure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/8a93cc58394ff1b133c5a21e51eff5cc.poster.avif?t=1754399398\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/8a93cc58394ff1b133c5a21e51eff5cc.webm?t=1754399398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/8a93cc58394ff1b133c5a21e51eff5cc.mp4?t=1754399398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the future, we plan to add a <strong>cooperative mode</strong> so you can share each adventure with two of your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/3c1eac68f60d4da4fb65fbd9c2c8de20.avif?t=1754399398\" /></span> </p>",
